# Battle Arena Infra Standards

- Compose orchestration only. Sibling repos remain independent.
- Default published ports bind to localhost via per-service variables (`API_BIND_ADDRESS`, `WEB_BIND_ADDRESS`, `POSTGRES_BIND_ADDRESS`, `REDIS_BIND_ADDRESS`, `MINIO_BIND_ADDRESS`). Postgres/Redis are never LAN-exposed.
- Never delete Docker volumes (e.g. `postgres_data`) without explicit approval.
- Never rotate Laravel `APP_KEY` with `--force` on startup.
- Do not hide init failures with `|| true`.
- Storage/RustFS is optional via `--profile storage` and private by default.
